Tool: find_sp500_stocks_by_metrics
Description: Find S&P 500 stocks by dividend yield and P/E ratio criteria.
Returns the top 10 S&P 500 stocks with dividend yield greater than the specified threshold
and P/E ratio below the specified threshold, sorted by highest dividend yield.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "yield_threshold": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Yield Threshold",
          "description": ""
        },
        "pe_threshold": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Pe Threshold",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "yield_threshold",
        "pe_threshold"
      ]
    }
